<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1904</h1><p class="ref-lede">1904 in world history: 21 events, 20 births, 19 deaths and 2 works. 800 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
